{"availability":"available","full":"Constantim-Cristian/grocery-assistant.v1","name":"grocery-assistant.v1","description":"This dashboard displays products from six different stores, sorted by the best price per unit of measure. You can filter products using a search bar, as well as by units of measurement and product categories. Selected items appear in a shopping cart, where you can adjust quantities and easily compare prices across all stores to find the best value.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-06-25T13:25:03Z","updated":"2025-07-27T18:05:11Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://appuctstoreappmainpy-qxaaofjlmggjkcejf3xyxx.streamlit.app/","topics":["demo"],"demo":"https://appuctstoreappmainpy-qxaaofjlmggjkcejf3xyxx.streamlit.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.729Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.729Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.729Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.729Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The data acquisition module is engineered for resilient and precise data extraction from dynamic API endpoints within the Wolt platform. It targets six prominent Romanian grocery retailers: Freshful, Profi, Penny, Auchan, Carrefour, and Kaufland."],"features":["Robust API Interaction: Employs sophisticated retry mechanisms with exponential backoff to effectively manage API rate limits and network transients. This ensures data integrity and reliability during collection.","Advanced Data Extraction & Normalization: Leverages powerful regular expressions for complex pattern matching and extraction of critical product attributes (e.g., quantities like \"6x0.33L\", \"100g\") from varied and often…","Unit Standardization & Price-per-Unit Calculation: Implements custom logic to standardize diverse measurement units (e.g., converting 'g' to 'kg', 'ml' to 'l'). This accurately calculates the crucial \"price per unit of…","Efficient Data Archiving: Collected data is intelligently compressed for daily archiving, ensuring efficient storage and providing a historical dataset for potential future analysis without consuming excessive disk…","Dynamic Category Mapping: Features a structured approach for rule-based product categorization, demonstrating a systematic method for semantic data organization."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Constantim-Cristian/grocery-assistant.v1/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8459f6b874e52c8870f8a6a704a454a44ab955bc2c0276cbc0095e7f8a0a0b00","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.898Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.898Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The data acquisition module is engineered for resilient and precise data extraction from dynamic API endpoints within the Wolt platform. It targets six prominent Romanian grocery retailers: Freshful, Profi, Penny, Auchan, Carrefour, and Kaufland.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Constantim-Cristian/grocery-assistant.v1/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8459f6b874e52c8870f8a6a704a454a44ab955bc2c0276cbc0095e7f8a0a0b00","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Constantim-Cristian/grocery-assistant.v1/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.898Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-07-27T18:05:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Constantim-Cristian/grocery-assistant.v1/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:11.899Z","hash":"8459f6b874e52c8870f8a6a704a454a44ab955bc2c0276cbc0095e7f8a0a0b00","originalBytes":4517,"storedBytes":4517,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","product","dynamic","ensuring","module","shopping","user","across","advanced","api","cart","complex","e.g.","efficient","extraction","filtering","search","techniques","within","acquisition","application","archiving","based","categorization","category","collected","comparison","cost","crucial","dashboar